        "usedFor": "Verification of dedicated subcontractor portal."
      }
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Staff headcount, internal project management software, and back-office CRM systems are not publicly disclosed on the website.",
      "Contractor license #8381215 was identified from page text but not independently cross-referenced against Idaho state licensing registries."
    ]
  },
  "qualification": {
    "category": "not a fit",
    "rationale": "Boise Remodeling Co. falls outside ForgeX's target market. ForgeX specifically serves owner-led home-service contractors in HVAC, plumbing, and electrical trades with approximately 10 to 75 staff who pay for leads. Boise Remodeling Co. is a residential design-build remodeling and general contracting company (kitchens, bathrooms, additions, ADUs, and whole-home renovations) operating as a DBA of P5 Home Co LLC with a lean, subcontractor-centric operating model."
  }
}
